{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "POWER CRISIS",
    "steam_appid": 2926100,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "POWER CRISIS is an unnerving puzzle/resource-management game, where you have nothing but your mind, a light, and your superhuman electrical abilities to help you avoid obstacles, ward off enemies, and progress between test chambers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/b4be5a474afcf415effd64bc3f40ed2c.avif?t=1732305790\" width=616 height=86 /></span><br>As you progress, you'll need to interact with special components-- plenty of which need to be powered by your stored electricity.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/f4d61176d7e3e6c734fb575d2f2303f0.poster.avif?t=1732305790\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/f4d61176d7e3e6c734fb575d2f2303f0.webm?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/f4d61176d7e3e6c734fb575d2f2303f0.mp4?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>For some chambers, you're given constant access to a generator, which you can use to charge up. Oftentimes though, your ability to access this generator is limited.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/70ae60d14b8ae8b5cb74b5b6630ab26c.poster.avif?t=1732305790\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/70ae60d14b8ae8b5cb74b5b6630ab26c.webm?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/70ae60d14b8ae8b5cb74b5b6630ab26c.mp4?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>While a misuse of power could mean nothing more than a slight time loss, there is another problem that can arise...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/65a9e6ea2494957e0730892e27aa86e6.avif?t=1732305790\" width=616 height=86 /></span><br>Bee, the player character, is deeply afraid of the dark. And, seeing what lies within it, you won't blame them.<br>First, being in the dark for too long will cause Bee to panic, giving you a slight setback on time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/071eb39146a570a9b98d59ba2051a134.poster.avif?t=1732305790\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/071eb39146a570a9b98d59ba2051a134.webm?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/071eb39146a570a9b98d59ba2051a134.mp4?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But, more pressing, you're not alone-- and you'll wish you were. Your light is your only weapon against the creatures that live within the dark.<br><br>Of course, beyond survival, there is one more reason you'll want to be efficient with your power usage...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/7534db69ab6c2e46b370b5b57b11bb18.avif?t=1732305790\" width=616 height=86 /></span><br>This mission isn't without consequences. The world depends on you, and as such, you need to prove you're up for the task. Once your test officially begins, your Power Rating score will continuously decrement. Each time you're knocked out, you will also face a penalty to this score. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/942d75976cd81665f5b6db2276f47f10.poster.avif?t=1732305790\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/942d75976cd81665f5b6db2276f47f10.webm?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/942d75976cd81665f5b6db2276f47f10.mp4?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The higher the score you have by the end, the better grade you will receive. If your score reaches 0, your mission will end. Speaking of which.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/94cc13e90b51c309cd5d22af4b9c04db.avif?t=1732305790\" width=616 height=86 /></span><br>You've been tasked with something you've been training for your entire life-- the preparation of a mysterious new power source, which should be powerful enough to save humanity from a new, incoming apocalypse. On your mission, you will have to use your power and your wits to interact with different mechanisms to ultimately allow you to progress. With a handful of different components to work with, you will constantly have to learn how new mechanisms work and interact with one another.  In this mission, your quick thinking is your only lifeline.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/2bf53c6d3e412e9be8b8d29a82f25d56.poster.avif?t=1732305790\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/2bf53c6d3e412e9be8b8d29a82f25d56.webm?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/2bf53c6d3e412e9be8b8d29a82f25d56.mp4?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "POWER CRISIS is an unnerving puzzle/resource-management game, where you have nothing but your mind, a light, and your superhuman electrical abilities to help you avoid obstacles, ward off enemies, and progress between test chambers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/b4be5a474afcf415effd64bc3f40ed2c.avif?t=1732305790\" width=616 height=86 /></span><br>As you progress, you'll need to interact with special components-- plenty of which need to be powered by your stored electricity.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/f4d61176d7e3e6c734fb575d2f2303f0.poster.avif?t=1732305790\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/f4d61176d7e3e6c734fb575d2f2303f0.webm?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/f4d61176d7e3e6c734fb575d2f2303f0.mp4?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>For some chambers, you're given constant access to a generator, which you can use to charge up. Oftentimes though, your ability to access this generator is limited.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/70ae60d14b8ae8b5cb74b5b6630ab26c.poster.avif?t=1732305790\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/70ae60d14b8ae8b5cb74b5b6630ab26c.webm?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/70ae60d14b8ae8b5cb74b5b6630ab26c.mp4?t=1732305790\" t