e. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/942d75976cd81665f5b6db2276f47f10.poster.avif?t=1732305790\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/942d75976cd81665f5b6db2276f47f10.webm?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/942d75976cd81665f5b6db2276f47f10.mp4?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The higher the score you have by the end, the better grade you will receive. If your score reaches 0, your mission will end. Speaking of which.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/94cc13e90b51c309cd5d22af4b9c04db.avif?t=1732305790\" width=616 height=86 /></span><br>You've been tasked with something you've been training for your entire life-- the preparation of a mysterious new power source, which should be powerful enough to save humanity from a new, incoming apocalypse. On your mission, you will have to use your power and your wits to interact with different mechanisms to ultimately allow you to progress. With a handful of different components to work with, you will constantly have to learn how new mechanisms work and interact with one another.  In this mission, your quick thinking is your only lifeline.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/2bf53c6d3e412e9be8b8d29a82f25d56.poster.avif?t=1732305790\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926100/extras/2bf53c6d3e412e9be8b8d29a82f25d56.webm?t=1732305790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><